04/15", weight="58", tooltip="NEIRA Boys & Girls Fours,Berkshire vs. Hotchkiss			
Distance: 1500 M Conditions: Very warm; mostly sunny; 7-10 mph tail/quartering tail wind, light at the start and strongest with some chop in the last 500. Comments: In G3, a Berkshire rower came off her seat, but managed to recover. Thanks to Hotchkiss for a great season-opening race.
